1. Button Styling

Create is plain white, Edit is green, and Delete is red. The inconsistent styling makes the interface feel unpolished and can confuse users about priority.

"Refresh" has a different style (green background, rounded edges), again inconsistent.

2. Alignment Issues

"From Date" and "To Date" fields are aligned horizontally, but the "Refresh" button sits slightly lower, breaking visual balance.

"Item Return to Supplier" text link on the top right looks detached and unaligned with other elements.

3. Font Consistency

Button fonts, table header fonts, and link fonts differ in size and weight.

Table header text isn’t vertically centered properly (some words appear too close to the top border).
4. Missing Sorting & Filtering

No column sort arrows or filters, which makes working with long data sets difficult.

Inconsistent with other screens (some had column filters).

5. Column Prioritization

Too many columns shown at once (Supplier Name, Voucher No., Challan Date, Particular, Created By, etc.). Not all of these are equally important. Should allow hiding or collapsing less-used fields.', 104, 7, 180, 187, CAST(N'2025-08-26T18:57:21.597' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2025-08-26T06:34:45.223' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2025-08-26T06:34:48.160' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2025-11-14T18:02:27.210' AS DateTime), N'Closed', N'Medium', N'Improvement', N'Simple', 202, CAST(N'2025-08-28T06:27:00.000' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2025-08-26T06:35:02.840' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2025-08-26T06:35:43.397' AS DateTime), N'Developer Complete', NULL, CAST(N'2025-08-26T06:35:59.193' AS DateTime), 1495, 1, 0, 500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL)
