Create, Edit, Delete, and Print use different background colors (blue, green, red, dark green) without a consistent hierarchy. This makes the UI look inconsistent and distracts users.

Buttons also have different paddings and font weights, making them visually uneven.

Alignment Issues

The From and To date pickers and Refresh button are not vertically aligned with the action buttons above.

