However, when the exact allocated paper is issued, the Job Card automatically gets removed from the list.
Proposed Improvement:
If a different paper is issued against the Job Card, then either:
The Job Card should still be highlighted With Color(to indicate alternate paper issued), or
The Job Card should be removed from the issue list after issuance (same as when allocated paper is issued).', 128, 7, 189, 146, CAST(N'2025-09-19T14:16:32.053' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL, N'Hold', N'High', N'Improvement', N'Simple', 2464, CAST(N'2026-01-15T19:24:00.000' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 60, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL)
