Open the Estimation Window for Corrugated Box.

Fill all the required details.

Click on the Show Cost button.

Now add the Corrugation Details and apply them.

Click on the Apply Cost button – it does not work.

The button only works if the user clicks the Modify button twice.

Expected Behavior:
After adding Corrugation Details and applying them, clicking on Apply Cost should work directly without needing to click Modify  button multiple times.

