Case A (Single Day): Set both From/To dates to 02-Apr-2026. Result: "No data."
Case B (Range Ending on Date): Set From: 18-Mar-2026 / To: 02-Apr-2026. Result: "No data."
Case C (Range Starting on Date): Set From: 02-Apr-2026 / To: 07-Apr-2026. Result: "No data."
Case D (Successful Range): Set From: 03-Apr-2026 / To: 07-Apr-2026. Result: Data loads correctly.', 180, 7, 213, 182, CAST(N'2026-04-07T00:00:00.000' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-05-18T06:13:04.587' AS DateTime), N'Closed', N'Normal', N'Bug', N'Simple', 3077, CAST(N'2026-04-09T04:21:00.000' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2026-04-15T06:38:16.760' AS DateTime), NULL, N'test', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 60, 9, 0, CAST(N'2026-04-15T19:08:09.257' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-04-24T05:57:25.957' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2026-04-09T16:39:13.867' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL)
