when we add any remarks in qc packing, we want that remark in the delivery note pending, because 
Explanation :- Whenever we undertake a job involving both an ''outer'' and an ''inner'' component, we manufacture only the ''outer'' part, as the ''inner'' part is already available with us as finished goods (FG). We then deliver this pre-existing ''inner'' component along with the newly manufactured ''outer'' part. Consequently, during the packing stage—specifically for such job cards—we add the details of the ''inner'' component to the ''Remarks'' section; this information serves as a reference for the person responsible for generating the Delivery Challan.', 164, 7, 170, 192, CAST(N'2026-04-27T00:00:00.000' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2026-05-06T18:55:15.093' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2026-05-06T18:55:38.940' AS DateTime), NULL, N'DevCompleted', N'High', N'Improvement', N'Simple', 3236, CAST(N'2026-04-27T04:03:00.000' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 60, 0, 0, CAST(N'2026-05-06T18:55:38.940' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-04-27T16:32:19.303' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL)
