1) Readability: Increase and standardize the font size across all fields.
2) Sales Order Number: Widen the column to keep values on a single line.
3) QR Code: Correct the structure and alignment.
4) Terminology: Update "With/Without Grain" to "Long Grain / Short Grain".
5) Field Removal: Remove the following unnecessary fields:
    - PO No
    - Product/ISBN Code
    - Job Reference
    - Job Output
    - Product Size (Inches)
6) Measurements: Remove inch-based measurements or convert them to centimeters.
7) Operations Table:
    - Ensure size values reflect properly in the operation details.
    - Add a new column for “Wastage”.

