Issue Date and Time
Artwork No.
Job Card No.
Designer
Sales Person
Client Name
Client Contact
Product Name
Category
Job Size
Quantity
Colour[ex-1 color/2 color/ 4 color] 
Estimated Completion Date

Additionally, the printout should contain a “Work Duration” table with:
Date, Time Taken
and a final row for: Total Hrs

The printout should also include:

Work Completed Date
Design Cost
Signature of Designer (blank space for manual signature)

