The Gang Job printout should be revised to match the layout and format of the Production Work Order (PWO) printout. The following changes are required:

Layout & Formatting
•	Increase the font size and enlarge all fields for better readability. 
•	Rearrange the field positions to match the sequence used in the Job Card/PWO printout. 
•	Bold important field labels for improved visibility. 
Add the following fields:
•	Delivery Place (currently Transporter) with the entered value displayed in bold. 
•	Make Ready Waste in the Production Material Details table. 
•	Color fields as displayed in the Job Card. 
•	Total Required Sheets (including process waste and make ready waste). 
•	Printing Style. 
•	Plate Quantity. 
Remove the following fields:
•	Binding Style. 
•	Finished Format. 
•	Plate Type. 
•	Unit. 
Grain Direction
•	Change Across Grain to Short Grain. 
•	Change With Grain to Long Grain. 

Kindly review the above requirements and update the Gang Job printout accordingly.
