For example, in Quote No. 6394, the impressions should be calculated as:

Full Sheets + Wastage = 275
Cut Sheets = 275 × 2 = 550
Total Impressions = 550 × 2 (Front & Back) = 1100

However, the system rounds the impressions to 2000 instead of using the calculated value of 1100.', 180, 7, 213, 153, CAST(N'2026-06-30T00:00:00.000' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-06-30T23:22:45.637' AS DateTime), N'Closed', N'High', N'Bug', N'Complex', 3957, CAST(N'2026-06-30T05:18:00.000' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 20, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-06-30T17:40:09.680' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL)
