Currently, if a quotation is unsent by the salesperson after it has been loaded in the Internal Approval screen, the approver can still approve the quotation without verifying its current status. The system should validate the quotation status at the time of approval and block the action if the quotation is no longer pending Internal Approval.', 180, 7, 213, 184, CAST(N'2026-07-04T00:00:00.000' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-18T11:39:50.527' AS DateTime), N'Closed', N'Medium', N'Improvement', N'Simple', 4014, CAST(N'2026-07-05T23:59:00.000' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 20, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-06T12:22:47.377' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL)
