Currently, if two users open the same pending Sales Order in the Production Work Order module and process/save it, the system allows the creation of multiple Job Cards against the same Sales Order. As a result, duplicate Job Cards are generated with different Job Card numbers for a single Sales Order.

The system should validate whether the Sales Order has already been processed into a Job Card and block any subsequent processing attempts by other users.', 180, 7, 213, 182, CAST(N'2026-07-04T00:00:00.000' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-08T18:24:30.197' AS DateTime), N'Closed', N'Medium', N'Improvement', N'Simple', 4013, CAST(N'2026-07-05T23:58:00.000' AS DateTime), CAST(N'2026-07-07T03:41:01.263' AS DateTime), NULL, N'done', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 30, 0, 0, CAST(N'2026-07-07T16:10:54.007' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, CAST(N'2026-07-06T12:21:31.153' AS DateTime), NULL, NULL, NULL)
